.TH CARTPENDULUM 2
.SH NAME
cartpendulum \- nonlinear cart and pendulum equation library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.EX
include "danby/cartpendulum.m";
.EE
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Cartpendulum
evaluates the coupled horizontal cart and pendulum derivatives, including cart
spring and damping forces and hinge damping.  State order is cart position,
cart velocity, pendulum angle, and angular velocity.
